msgid "Framebuffer 启动徽标"
msgstr "Framebuffer Boot Logo"

msgid "显示与移除"
msgstr "Display and Removal"

msgid ""
"索引颜色图像直接嵌入内核只读数据，无需文件系统或用户态加载。 按发现的逻辑 CPU 数量绘制图标，适当留距，屏幕不足时换行或缩放，同时保留 文本行。该数量不是 CPU "
"插槽数。用户态启动前移除徽标，恢复完整控制台。 绘制遵守 framebuffer pitch、原生颜色与边界；不能因图像更换覆盖屏外内存。"
msgstr ""
"The indexed-color image is embedded directly in the kernel's read-only data and needs no "
"filesystem or userspace loading. Icons are drawn for the number of detected logical CPUs, with "
"suitable spacing and wrapping or scaling when screen space is insufficient, while leaving room for"
" text lines. This count is not the number of CPU sockets. The logos are removed before userspace "
"starts, restoring the full console. Drawing respects framebuffer pitch, native colors, and bounds;"
" replacing the image must not cause writes beyond screen memory."

msgid "验证"
msgstr "Validation"

msgid ""
"make test-boot-logo 使用实际绘制器检查 RAM surface；QEMU 的数量、留距、 持续显示和自动隐藏要由真实启动画面检查。VMware 验证未完成，不能从 QEMU "
"设备模拟推导真实 VMware 或物理硬件显示成功。"
msgstr ""
"make test-boot-logo checks a RAM surface using the actual renderer. Counts, spacing, persistent "
"display, and automatic hiding in QEMU must be checked against actual boot screens. VMware "
"validation is incomplete; QEMU device emulation does not establish successful display on real "
"VMware or physical hardware."
